<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-five-formulas-title"><h4 id="topic-five-formulas-title"><?php echo s($damptext('When the herb leads the formula', 'Cuando la hierba dirige la fórmula')); ?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($damptext('Only chief connections within the current 63-formula Board roster appear here.', 'Aquí aparecen solamente relaciones principales dentro del listado Board vigente de 63 fórmulas.')); ?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__formula-leads"><article class="single-herbs-guide__formula-lead"><h5>Huang Lian</h5><p><strong>Huang Lian Jie Du Tang:</strong> <?php echo s($damptext('chief herb for blazing Fire-Toxin across the three Burners.', 'hierba principal para Fuego-Toxina intenso en los tres Calentadores.')); ?></p></article><article class="single-herbs-guide__formula-lead"><h5>Long Dan Cao</h5><p><strong>Long Dan Xie Gan Tang:</strong> <?php echo s($damptext('chief herb for excess Liver/Gallbladder Fire and Liver-channel Damp-Heat.', 'hierba principal para Fuego por exceso de Hígado/Vesícula y Humedad-Calor del canal de Hígado.')); ?></p></article></div><p class="single-herbs-guide__scope-note"><strong><?php echo s($damptext('Role check:', 'Verificación de función:')); ?></strong> <?php echo s($damptext('Huang Qin and Huang Bai support several current formulas but do not lead them. No off-roster formula is presented as active Board content.', 'Huang Qin y Huang Bai apoyan varias fórmulas vigentes, pero no las dirigen. Ninguna fórmula fuera del listado se presenta como contenido Board activo.')); ?></p></section>

<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-five-comparisons-title"><h4 id="topic-five-comparisons-title"><?php echo s($damptext('High-yield comparisons', 'Comparaciones de alto rendimiento')); ?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($damptext('Use location before opening the full comparison.', 'Usa la localización antes de abrir la comparación completa.')); ?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__comparisons"><?php foreach ($dampcomparisons as $comparison): ?><?php $comparisonpath = $ises && !empty($comparison['path_es']) ? $comparison['path_es'] : $comparison['path']; $comparisonurl = new moodle_url($comparisonpath, ['from' => 'single-herbs', 'focus' => (string) $selected['number']]); ?><a class="single-herbs-guide__comparison" href="<?php echo $comparisonurl->out(false); ?>"><strong><?php echo s($comparison['title']); ?></strong><span><?php echo s($comparison['summary']); ?></span><small><?php echo s($damptext('Open full comparison →', 'Abrir comparación completa →')); ?></small></a><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>

